window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>When my mate disappeared, I never thought I’d see him again—or be pregnant with his baby.</b></p> <p>I was almost forty and thought I’d never find my mate—until Beck showed up in town. My wolf was captivated by this dragon shifter from an ancient clan, and we spent every waking moment together, until he vanished without a trace.</p> <p>My shifter coven used all the magic we could muster but still couldn’t find my beloved mate. Assuming he was dead, my wolf howled in agony. Two years later, I got the shock of a lifetime.</p> <p>A stranger was brought to our coven for help, but this man was no stranger to my wolf—under all that bedraggled hair was Beck, with no memory of his identity, or even me.</p> <p>All he knows is he was held captive on an island all this time. How do I begin to revive the bond we once had? There’s so much he doesn’t know, secrets time has buried—like his two-year-old son asleep nearby, the baby he never knew I had.</p> <p><i>Steamy shifter love scenes and a HEA inside! No cheating or cliffhanger in this standalone romance. Listeners 18+.</i></p>"; 
